  directives:
  - day: 1
    directiveTypes: 000000000600000001000000
    bodyText: 'Citizens of Artotzka require <b>Identification.</b>


      All foreigners
      require an <b>Entry permit</b> and <b>Supporting documents</b>


'
  - day: 3
    directiveTypes: 00000000060000000100000004000000
    bodyText: 'Citizens of Artotzka require <b>Identification.</b>


      All foreigners
      require an <b>Entry permit</b> and <b>Supporting documents</b>


      Immediately
      exterminate any Skinwalker '
  - day: 3
    directiveTypes: 000000000600000001000000020000000300000004000000
    bodyText: 'Citizens of Artotzka require <b>Identification.</b>


      All foreigners
      require an <b>Entry permit</b> and <b>Supporting documents</b>


      Reject
      any Applicant with a history of <b>Major Offences</b>


      Exterminate any
      Applicant that is suspected of having been <b>Exposed to a Skinwalker</b>


      Immediately
      <b>exterminate any Skinwalker</b>'
